caption: Prestige Reset
rule: prestige-reset

After Prestiging, reset the character's value to the campaign's Prestige Reset Value and increase Prestige Count by the number of levels completed.

Marks awarded before the reset retain their historical earned value but do not re-add spent pre-Prestige character points after the reset. Marks awarded afterward use the new Mark Value progression.
